{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["<b>And Benjamin's portion was increased.</b> In order to see whether they would be envious of him." "<b>Five shares.</b> For alongside every portion he sent to each pair of them, as was the custom, he would send a portion to Benjamin, to show his preeminence over all of them." "<b>And they drank with him.</b> With an abundance of royal wine that he set before them, which they were not accustomed to, and they did not take care to refrain from drinking their fill from the outset, as is proper for every diner with great men to do, as it says: כִּי תֵשֵׁב לִלְחוֹם אֶת מוֹשֵׁל בִּין תָּבִין אֶת אֲשֶׁר לְפָנֶיךָ (Proverbs 23:1)."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 43, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:34:29.297470153Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}